":"Most AI tools use trained models to recognize patterns in text, images, audio, code, or data. You provide a prompt, file, question, or workflow, and the tool returns an output or automates part of the task. The best results come from choosing a tool built for the job and reviewing important output before you use it."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What are the best AI tools right now?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The best AI tool depends on what you need to accomplish, your budget, and the way your team works. Compare tools by use case, reviews, pricing, integrations, and the quality of their output rather than looking for one tool that fits everyone."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Where can I find the best free AI tools?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Many AI products offer free plans, trials, or useful freemium features. Free tools can be a practical way to test a new workflow before committing, although limits on usage, exports, collaboration, or advanced models may apply."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Which AI tools are useful for business?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Business teams use AI tools for customer support, sales research, meeting notes, reporting, content production, knowledge management, and workflow automation. Start with a specific bottleneck, then evaluate privacy controls, team features, integrations, and total cost before rolling a tool out."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How can AI tools improve productivity?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"AI can speed up repeatable work such as drafting, summarizing, organizing information, preparing first-pass analysis, and turning notes into next steps. It is most helpful when it removes low-value busywork while people stay responsible for judgment, accuracy, and final decisions."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What are the best AI tools for marketing?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Marketing teams use AI for brainstorming campaigns, drafting copy, creating images and video, repurposing content, analyzing audiences, and improving search visibility. Look for tools that support your existing brand workflow and let your team review and refine every asset."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What AI tools should developers use?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Developers often use AI tools for code completion, debugging, documentation, testing, design-to-code work, and technical research. Choose tools that fit your editor and stack, protect sensitive code appropriately, and keep code review and testing in the development process."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How can startups use AI tools?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Startups can use AI to move faster across research, product prototyping, customer support, marketing, operations, and analytics. A focused stack of well-integrated tools is usually more useful than adding AI everywhere; measure the time saved and the quality gained as you adopt each one."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How does the AITopTools directory help me discover AI tools?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"AITopTools brings AI software together in one searchable directory so you can discover tools by category, see new additions, compare options, and read user reviews. Use it to turn a broad need into a short list of tools worth trying."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How do I submit my AI tool to AITopTools?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Use the submission page to add your AI tool to the directory. Submissions are completed through checkout, and the selected plan explains the publication process and timing. You will receive confirmation at the email address you provide."}}]}]}  Top 100  Free  New  Categories Discover View All AI Tools Top 100 AI Tools Free AI Tools New Additions Categories Business & Productivity 3,163 Tech & Development 2,589 Design & Media 2,053 Writing & Content 1,825 Lifestyle & Growth 1,316 Browse all categories Find the Best   AI Tools . Search, compare, and discover the right AI tool for any task. Search, compare, and discover curated AI tools for business, creativity, development, and everyday tasks. Search AI Tools Find By Goal Search AI tools Search by tool, category, or use case Search AI Tools Explore New AI Tools Browse Categories Get your AI tool discovered Put Your AI Tool in Front of 1.4M+ Users Submit your website and we'll create your AITopTools listing in seconds. 1.4M+  users · 25M+  page views · DR 57+ List My AI Tool 🚀 Want more exposure? We’ll submit your tool to 100+ AI directories for you. Get Distributed to 100+ Directories → Featured AI Tools Standout AI tools worth exploring. Interested in showing up here? Contact us Indexera Verified tool 5.0 ( 5 ) Indexera is a custom programmatic SEO and AI search optimization service that helps businesses build massive organic visibility across Google and AI-powered search platforms. Sponsored Marketing + 1 CPS Pays Contact for pricing Payment processing for AI businesses. Sponsored Finance GeoFide.AI Verified tool Freemium 5.0 ( 5 ) GeoFide is a Generative Engine Optimization (GEO) platform that helps businesses get their content cited and recommended by AI search engines like ChatGPT, Perplexity, and Claude — with AI-powered analysis and autonomous optimization agents. Sponsored SEO Generator + 1 New AI Tools The latest AI tools added to AITopTools. List your tool See all new  WThumb Verified tool From $12/mo; 2 free credits to start WThumb is an AI thumbnail maker for YouTube and Shorts. Remake a thumbnail you like from a link or image, describe the one you want, or pick a ready-made Classic or Faceless template, with your face or without. Full HD+ JPEG, no watermark, 2 free credits to start. Design Tool Freemium Mova Verified tool Free for 7 days. Mova is an AI job search tool that scans 30+ job boards daily, matches newly posted roles to a user profile, and creates tailored application strategy materials. Human Resources Free trial Veo3 Flow AI Video Generator Verified tool Veo3 is a browser-based AI video generator for creating Veo 3.1 videos from text prompts or images. It supports video generation with native audio, selectable aspect ratios and resolution options. Video Generator Modellix.ai Verified tool Paid One API key for every leading AI image, video and audio model, plus top LLMs. Transparent pay-as-you-go pricing and a browser Playground. Developer Wonderslide Verified tool Create your presentation — free Wonderslide is an AI presentation maker that turns a task description and uploaded materials into a structured, designed slide deck. Users can review the outline, refine the deck in chat, and download presentations as PPTX or PDF. Presentation Maker Free Subgrow Verified tool Start for free Subgrow creates and publishes one Reddit post per day in a company’s own subreddit to help its content appear in Google and AI search results. It identifies relevant buyer questions and prepares posts for review before publishing. SEO Generator Voicestars Verified tool Voicestars is an AI music platform for generating AI covers from uploaded tracks or YouTube links, selecting from a library of AI voices, and creating full songs from text prompts. Music Generator AEO Action Verified tool $149 a month. 7-day trial, no credit card. AEO Action monitors how AI search tools answer buyer questions about your business and prepares approved content and schema intended to help your business get named in those answers. SEO Generator DetectGPT Verified tool Free, no account DetectGPT is a free AI text checker that analyzes pasted text or public page URLs and returns an AI percentage with highlighted passages. It supports checks for writing associated with ChatGPT, Claude, Grok, Gemini, and other LLMs. Detector Free Fashion Diffusion Verified tool Free trial Fashion Diffusion is an AI fashion design platform for creating clothing visuals, product imagery, model photos, virtual try-ons, and short-form fashion videos. It is built for fashion brands, designers, and e-commerce teams. Design Tool BatchData Verified tool BatchData provides real estate data, APIs, and data services for property research, enrichment, search, valuation, and contact-related workflows. It offers custom data delivery for business needs. Real Estate SignalVan Verified tool Free. No card. SignalVan is a signal-first prospecting tool that identifies companies showing current buying intent, verifies decision-maker contact details, and drafts a tailored first outreach line. Lead Generation Paid GetSolved Verified tool kostenlose KI-Schreibassistent GetSolved is an AI writing assistant for essays, reports, and everyday writing tasks. You can use it to fix grammar mistakes, rewrite sentences, check facts, and spot signs of AI-generated text. Writing Assistant Freemium Nano Banana CN Verified tool Freemium Turn simple text into images and videos | Nano Banana, GPT Image and Seedance models. Image Generator Empacer Verified tool Empacer is a voice AI business assistant for business owners. It turns spoken instructions into drafted work while retaining business context such as prices, clients, tone, and past work. Assistant SceneMixer Verified tool Credit-based pricing: 50 free credits on sign-up, first dram SceneMixer is an AI short drama generator that turns scripts, novels, or ideas into serialized video dramas with reference art, storyboards, per-shot video, and episode compositing. Video Generator Kurodyne Verified tool Paid Kurodyne is a digital product marketplace where one creator's work becomes another's starting point. Buy agent skills, app starters, templates, and design kits, or sell what you've built. Find your next tool directly from your AI agent. Ecommerce Seedance 2.5 on Yovid Verified tool Freemium Seedance 2.5 free online: 4–30 second AI videos with sound, from text, frames or references. Video Generator PopNow Verified tool Paid Create images, videos, music and voiceovers in a browser-based AI studio, with a developer API and MCP connections for creative workflows. Content Creator CloneCut AI Verified tool CloneCut is an AI viral video cloner that creates visual variations of short reference videos. It can replace people, products, objects, or backgrounds while aiming to preserve the original motion and timing. Video Generator Rankin AI Verified tool Rankin AI is an AI visibility tool for tracking brand presence in AI search and identifying prioritized improvements. It monitors rankings, mentions, citations, competitors, and site issues across AI platforms. Analytics CleanSmart Verified tool Starter $59/mth, Pro $179/mth, Business $399/mth CleanSmart is a no-code CRM data-cleaning platform that deduplicates, standardizes, fills missing values, and flags anomalies. It connects to supported CRMs and commerce platforms or accepts CSV uploads. Database Free trial LongTerMemory Verified tool 5.0 ( 1 ) LongTerMemory is an AI study tool that turns uploaded learning materials into personalized study plans, quizzes, and spaced-repetition reviews. Education AMW Suite Verified tool From $279/mo, billed yearly AMW Suite brings a CRM, calling, texting and email, a help desk, proposals, e-signatures and client portals into one system, with AI agents that draft the routine work for your team to approve. Other Paid View More AI Tools  Explore with confidence FAQs about  AI tools. Clear answers for choosing, comparing, and getting more from the right AI tools. 01 What are AI tools? AI tools are software products that use artificial intelligence to help people create, analyze, automate, research, communicate, or make decisions. They range from everyday writing assistants and image generators to specialized business, developer, and data tools. 02 How do AI tools work? Most AI tools use trained models to recognize patterns in text, images, audio, code, or data. You provide a prompt, file, question, or workflow, and the tool returns an output or automates part of the task. The best results come from choosing a tool built for the job and reviewing important output before you use it. 03 What are the best AI tools right now? The best AI tool depends on what you need to accomplish, your budget, and the way your team works. Compare tools by use case, reviews, pricing, integrations, and the quality of their output rather than looking for one tool that fits everyone. Browse the Top 100 AI Tools 04 Where can I find the best free AI tools? Many AI products offer free plans, trials, or useful freemium features. Free tools can be a practical way to test a new workflow before committing, although limits on usage, exports, collaboration, or advanced models may apply. Explore Free AI Tools 05 Which AI tools are useful for business? Business teams use AI tools for customer support, sales research, meeting notes, reporting, content production, knowledge management, and workflow automation. Start with a specific bottleneck, then evaluate privacy controls, team features, integrations, and total cost before rolling a tool out. Browse AI tool categories 06 How can AI tools improve productivity? AI can speed up repeatable work such as drafting, summarizing, organizing information, preparing first-pass analysis, and turning notes into next steps. It is most helpful when it removes low-value busywork while people stay responsible for judgment, accuracy, and final decisions. 07 What are the best AI tools for marketing? Marketing teams use AI for brainstorming campaigns, drafting copy, creating images and video, repurposing content, analyzing audiences, and improving search visibility. Look for tools that support your existing brand workflow and let your team review and refine every asset. Browse marketing AI tool categories 08 What AI tools should developers use? Developers often use AI tools for code completion, debugging, documentation, testing, design-to-code work, and technical research. Choose tools that fit your editor and stack, protect sensitive code appropriately, and keep code review and testing in the development process. Browse developer AI tool categories 09 How can startups use AI tools? Startups can use AI to move faster across research, product prototyping, customer support, marketing, operations, and analytics. A focused stack of well-integrated tools is usually more useful than adding AI everywhere; measure the time saved and the quality gained as you adopt each one. See newly added AI tools 10 How does the AITopTools directory help me discover AI tools? AITopTools brings AI software together in one searchable directory so you can discover tools by category, see new additions, compare options, and read user reviews. Use it to turn a broad need into a short list of tools worth trying. Browse the AI tools directory View new AI tools 11 How do I submit my AI tool to AITopTools? Use the submission page to add your AI tool to the directory. Submissions are completed through checkout, and the selected plan explains the publication process and timing. You will receive confirmation at the email address you provide. Submit your AI tool AITopTools — The Original AI Tools Directory Since 2023 Explore a huge, always-growing library of 11,000+ AI tools — all with reviews from real users. Find the right AI tool, quickly and easily. The AI Newsletter Subscribe Backed by Company About Us Customer Stories Advertise Affiliate Program Contact Sitemap Resources AI Guides The AI Blog AI News Help & FAQ Submit a Tool AI Tool Submission Sites Claim Your Listing Explore Browse AI Categories All AI Tools Top 100 AI Tools Free AI Tools New AI Tools Newsletter Copyright ©  2026  – AITopTools™. All rights reserved. · Terms & Conditions · Privacy Policy · Refund Policy (self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0]) self.__next_f.push([1,"1:"$Sreact.fragment"
